      "created_at": "2020-09-22T14:51:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Baldrekr\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/7ab992/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Baldrekr:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I just got a notification that the last pallet of playmats was damaged in the warehouse, but they have decided to ship the rest of my order now. The playmat will be shipped separately in 3 weeks. I don’t see anything on backer kit or any notifications from ups/fedex but hopefully it will just show up soon.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I got the same email, and also no notification about a tracking number. I emailed customer services about this 20 minutes ago. If/when I get an update, I’ll let you know what the situation is.</p>",
